{"id": "3192655", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3192655", "title": "Auckland Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu feminin", "text": "Auckland Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu feminin a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii ianuarie 2025. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Auckland disputat pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Anna Danilina \u0219i Vikt\u00f3ria Hrun\u010d\u00e1kov\u00e1 au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar Hrun\u010d\u00e1kov\u00e1 nu particip\u0103 \u00een acest an, iar Danilina a ales s\u0103 concureze la Brisbane International.\nJiang Xinyu \u0219i Wu Fang-hsien au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul, dup\u0103 ce le-au \u00eenvins \u00een final\u0103 pe Aleksandra Kruni\u0107 \u0219i Sabrina Santamaria cu 6\u20133, 6\u20134."}
